# 1. Release Readiness Header — Team & Fix Version Dropdown Width Enhancement

## Background

The Team and Fix Version dropdowns in the Release Readiness header appear as small, narrow boxes that are visually inconsistent with the importance of these selectors. The available horizontal space to the right of the "Release Readiness" heading is not being utilized.

## Problem Statement

The dropdowns are too narrow and small. They must expand to use the available horizontal space to the right of the heading and be proportionate to the full header width.

