# 8. Status Logic + Tooltip Enhancement

## Background

The deployment status per component needs to be a single clear message with supplementary detail available on hover (tooltip). The previous bundle established the priority order — this section refines the exact messages and tooltip behavior.

## Status Messages and Tooltip Specification

| Status | Condition | Display Style | Tooltip on Hover |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Valid** | Branches match (normalized) AND K8s commit = latest release commit | Green badge | "K8s branch and commit match the release branch. Deployment is current." |
| **Older Branch** | Normalized K8s branch ≠ Normalized release branch | Orange badge | "K8s is running branch: {k8sBranchNormalized}. Expected: {releaseBranch}. Component may be on a previous release." |
| **Needs Redeployment** | Branches match AND K8s commit ≠ latest release commit AND latestReleaseCommitId is available | Amber badge | "Deployed commit: {k8sCommitId}. Latest release commit: {latestReleaseCommitId}. Run Force Refresh for commit-behind count." |
| **Branch Valid — Commit Unverified** | Branches match AND latestReleaseCommitId is NULL | Blue/Info badge | "Branch matches release branch but commit comparison is not available. Generate Report first to populate commit data, or run Force Refresh." |
| **Unable to Validate** | K8s call failed OR branch resolution failed OR cookie invalid | Grey badge | "Validation could not be completed. Reason: {errorMessage}" |
| **User Excluded** | Component is User Excluded (still shown in Refresh) | Grey italic | "This component is marked as User Excluded. It is shown here for visibility only." |

## Functional Requirements

| # | Requirement |
|---|---|
| FR-8.1 | Only **one status badge** per component row — no multiple indicators. |
| FR-8.2 | Each status badge must show a **tooltip on hover** with the detail message from the table above. |
| FR-8.3 | Tooltip must include actual values (branch names, commit SHAs) where specified. |
| FR-8.4 | Status determination must use **normalized** branch values — never raw strings. |
| FR-8.5 | The "Commits Behind" column must NOT exist. Status and tooltip carry all needed information in Refresh mode. |
| FR-8.6 | Commit SHAs shown in tooltips must be **full 40-character SHAs**. |

## Acceptance Criteria

```
AC-8.1
GIVEN K8s branch "release-26-07-28-rel" and DB release branch "release/26.07.28.rel"
AND K8s commit SHA matches latestReleaseCommitId in DB
WHEN the row renders
THEN status badge shows "Valid" in green
AND tooltip reads "K8s branch and commit match the release branch. Deployment is current."

AC-8.2
GIVEN K8s branch "release-26-06-14-rel" (older release)
AND DB release branch is "release/26.07.28.rel"
WHEN normalized comparison runs
THEN status badge shows "Older Branch" in orange
AND tooltip shows the actual K8s branch and expected branch names

AC-8.3
GIVEN branches match AND K8s commit SHA is "abc123..." (40 chars)
AND latestReleaseCommitId in DB is "def456..." (40 chars) — different
WHEN status is determined
THEN status badge shows "Needs Redeployment" in amber
AND tooltip shows both full SHAs and instructs user to run Force Refresh for count

AC-8.4
GIVEN branches match AND latestReleaseCommitId is NULL in DB
WHEN status is determined
THEN status badge shows "Branch Valid — Commit Unverified" in blue
